    16	    - Identify the training pair by matching interior color sets; the other non-blank frame is the test input.
    17	    - Infer the rule mapping source→destination (e.g. reflection, color inversion, gap filling, endpoint extraction, or checkerboard complement).
    18	    - Apply that same rule to the test sprite; output the transformed interior.
